ttested and local source modes report unknown prompt code-review-project-review-phase-boundaries while listing only built-ins. Offline project-prompt tests pass and the file exists at .rebar/prompts/code-review-project-review-phase-boundaries.md.\\n\\n## Plan\\n\\n- Reproduce review-code prompt discovery through the real CLI in a temporary repository/worktree.\\n- Trace repo_root propagation into project criteria routing and prompt loading.\\n- Make project-owned code-review prompts resolve consistently in attested and local source modes without changing built-in prompt behavior.\\n- Add a behavioral CLI regression test that runs review-code far enough to select the project prompt, using a fake runner to avoid a live model call.\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n- [ ] review-code resolves an activated project-owned code-review prompt from .rebar/prompts.\\n- [ ] Both attested and local source modes use the same project prompt registry semantics.\\n- [ ] Unknown project prompt identifiers still fail closed with a clear error.\\n- [ ] A behavioral regression test exercises public review-code dispatch without source-text grep assertions.\\n- [ ] make lint, make typecheck, and make test pass.","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["code-review","prompt-registry"],"ticket_id":"6ba6-ae90-28a6-4394","ticket_type":"bug","title":"review-code cannot resolve active project prompt from .rebar/prompts","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["3a27aa83-7b3d-4bd4-8141-e9205edcc912","60171cad-712e-41bc-a26f-dae682810427"]},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1785218232167707002,"uuid":"e446ec46-1b4e-4b64-8b71-779996f06992"}